/v1/","context":{"app_id":3264600,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3264600-1845383656388566","game_id":"steam-3264600","kind":"announcement","title":"Arcane Whispers: The Last Stand — Releasing November 6!","summary":"Hello gamers!The wait is almost over.On November 6, step into the role of Zephon, the last Guardian, and explore a shattered world of floating islands in this third-person action-adventure.Harness the powers of Fire, Water, Earth, and Air. Carefully manage each element as you battle elemental foes, overcome environmental puzzles, discover new abilities, and explore the Arcane Realms.Arcane Whispers: The Last Stand launches November 6.Thank you for following the game and supporting its developmen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T07:40:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388566","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3264600-1826992588599562","game_id":"steam-3264600","kind":"announcement","title":"Arcane Whispers: The Last Stand demo is now available!","summary":"Hello gamers!I'm excited to finally share the Arcane Whispers: The Last Stand demo!You can play through one full level of the shattered world and try a selection of elemental abilities. Harness the powers of Fire, Water, Earth, and Air to fight enemies and overcome the challenges ahead.If you give the demo a try, I’d really love to hear your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-15T13:15:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588599562","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3264600-1816307528942717","game_id":"steam-3264600","kind":"update","title":"Game Juice Update – 2-week playtesting session available","summary":"Hello gamers!I'm excited to bring you a major update packed with graphical upgrades, UI improvements, audio polish, and general game-feel enhancements.🌈 Graphics & LightingImproved Shadows: Especially noticeable on higher quality settings.LUT Blending: Smooth color and mood transitions, e.g. when entering the Research Facility.Sun Flares: New lens flare effects for a more cinematic atmosphere.Volumetric Lights: Realistic light shafts and enhanced depth.Radiant GI: Effects like the sword glow int","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-14T10:32:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528942717","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3264600-1800357164530779","game_id":"steam-3264600","kind":"announcement","title":"Animation Overhaul, Combat Tweaks & Storytelling Push","summary":"Hello gamers! This update has been a long time coming, and I’m excited to finally share it with you! ⚙️ Under-the-Hood Changes A lot of this update won't be immediately visible, but it's important. The game’s codebase has grown a lot, and I’ve spent time cleaning things up and rewriting systems (especially animation handling) to make development smoother and more scalable. This sets me up better for future content and stability. 🎥 Narrative & Cutscenes Since the beginning, this game has always b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-26T09:41:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1800357164530779","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3264600-1791580426130612","game_id":"steam-3264600","kind":"update","title":"UI Overhaul & Full Gamepad Support Update!","summary":"Hello gamers! I've completely overhauled the menu UI, making it more intuitive and visually polished. But that's not all! 🎮 Full Gamepad Support – Seamlessly browse menus with full controller integration. ⚙️ Expanded Customization – More options than ever to tailor the experience to your preferences. 🌍 Localization Added – Enjoy the game in three different languages for deeper immersion. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45247884/07175d1b73c0ddd2c7d7fc9c2f73bdefbeea3710.png Jump in and explore the brand-new in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-02-18T16:37:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1791580426130612","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3264600-1789039014436447","game_id":"steam-3264600","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Recap: Feedback, Fixes, and Features","summary":"Thank You, Playtesters! 🎮 I just wanted to take a moment to thank all of you amazing playtesters who have tried out my game over the past two weeks. Your time, feedback, and willingness to share your data have been incredibly helpful in making improvements. One of the tools I built for this playtest is a \"Graveyard\" heatmap that tracks where player deaths occur. It’s been a fantastic resource for identifying problem areas, like the \"Air\" stage, which had a lot of player deaths (including one rag","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-19T16:21:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1789039014436447","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3264600-1787858252812743","game_id":"steam-3264600","kind":"announcement","title":"I Need Your Feedback! Beta Playtest Now Live","summary":"Hi everyone, I’m thrilled to share the Demo Playtest for my game, Arcane Whispers: The Last Stand! This is my very first playtest build, and it’s your chance to explore the demo level, dive into the world I’ve been creating, and help me make the game even better. As a solo developer, I handle every aspect of the game, so your feedback is incredibly valuable to me. Right now, I’m particularly looking for input on: Character movement: How does it feel? Level progression and pacing: Does it flow we","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-05T13:53:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1787858252812743","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3264600-6148070194801695585","game_id":"steam-3264600","kind":"announcement","title":"Major Graphics Overhaul: A New Visual Experience","summary":"Main Character Model Refresh Enhanced Design: The main character model now has a lower poly count for a cleaner, more cohesive look that fits well with the low-poly environment. The mesh has been refined with smoother, rounded shapes to prevent the character from looking out of place. Character Detail: Subtle vines now adorn the character’s body, adding a sense of depth and personality. A revised color palette employs contrasting hues to help the character stand out against the background, impro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-10T15:52:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6148070194801695585","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3264600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:11Z","statu